# Environment template

Turbo PBN does not load a `.env` file. Bootstrap values live in `config.php`:

- `timezone` — PHP timezone (default Asia/Jakarta)
- `database_path` — SQLite file location
- `uploads_path` / `uploads_url` — image storage
- `debug` — `false` in production

Never put passwords or tracking IDs in this file or in `.env`. Use Admin → Settings.
